@startuml
allowmixing
scale max 1920 width
top to bottom direction
!pragma layout smetana

title Prescription Analysis - Key Classes

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 60
skinparam ranksep 85
skinparam defaultFontName Nanum Gothic
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam ArrowThickness 2
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

skinparam classBackgroundColor<<UI>> #E8F4FF
skinparam classBorderColor<<UI>> #147BC1
skinparam classBackgroundColor<<Control>> #EAF8F0
skinparam classBorderColor<<Control>> #159957
skinparam classBackgroundColor<<Service>> #F8FAFC
skinparam classBorderColor<<Service>> #64748B
skinparam classBackgroundColor<<Entity>> #F5F3FF
skinparam classBorderColor<<Entity>> #7C3AED
skinparam classBackgroundColor<<External>> #FFF7E6
skinparam classBorderColor<<External>> #D97706

package "Flutter Frontend" #E8F4FF {
  class GuidedPrescriptionCameraUI <<UI>>
  class PrescriptionCameraOrientationService <<Service>>
  class PrescriptionImageCropService <<Service>>
  class PrescriptionLocalOcrService <<Service>>
  class PrescriptionOcrReadingOrder <<Service>>
  class PrescriptionPrivacyFilter <<Service>>
  class PrescriptionAnalysisPreviewUI <<UI>>
  class MedicationCandidateDialog <<UI>>
  class CheckResultUI <<UI>>
  class PrescriptionChangeRadarUI <<UI>>
  class "CheckPrescriptionChange" as FCheckPrescriptionChange <<Control>>
  class MedBuddyPrescriptionViewModel <<Control>>
  class "CheckMedicationDetail" as FCheckMedicationDetail <<Control>>
  class MedicationMatchReview <<Entity>>
  class MedicationLookupBusy <<Exception>>
  class "InputPrescription" as FInputPrescription <<Control>>
}

package "FastAPI Backend" #EAF8F0 {
  class "InputPrescription" as BInputPrescription <<Control>>
  class OCRServiceBoundary <<Service>>
  note "prescription_privacy.py\ndeidentify_prescription_text()" as PrescriptionPrivacy
  class "PrescriptionMedicationNameVerifier" as MedicationNameVerifier <<Service>>
  class "MedicationSchedule" as BMedicationSchedule <<Entity>>
  class "CheckMedicationDetail" as BCheckMedicationDetail <<Control>>
  class "CheckPrescriptionChange" as BCheckPrescriptionChange <<Control>>
  class "medication_match_safety" as MatchSafety <<Module>> {
    + match_conflict(original, candidate)
    + can_auto_match(original, candidate)
  }
}

cloud "Gemini 비식별 텍스트 분석" as Gemini

GuidedPrescriptionCameraUI -right-> PrescriptionImageCropService : crops to guide
GuidedPrescriptionCameraUI -down-> PrescriptionCameraOrientationService : camera-only rotation
PrescriptionImageCropService -right-> PrescriptionLocalOcrService : captured image
PrescriptionLocalOcrService -down-> PrescriptionPrivacyFilter : masks identifiers
PrescriptionLocalOcrService --> PrescriptionOcrReadingOrder : 개인정보 판단 뒤 화면 행 순서로 정렬
PrescriptionPrivacyFilter -right-> PrescriptionAnalysisPreviewUI : masked OCR regions
MedBuddyPrescriptionViewModel --> FInputPrescription : 이미지 입력·OCR 인식
FInputPrescription -down-> BInputPrescription : authenticated API
BInputPrescription -right-> OCRServiceBoundary : structures text
BInputPrescription --> PrescriptionPrivacy : 서버 입력 재검사
OCRServiceBoundary --> PrescriptionPrivacy : 외부 제공자 호출 직전 재검사
note bottom of PrescriptionPrivacy
  약 정보가 없는 식별 줄·라벨 구역은 빼고 라벨 없는 날짜·번호는 가린다.
  환자 정보와 약 행이 한 줄에 섞이면 AI 호출 전에 거절한다.
  기기 검토를 대체하거나 모든 개인정보 제거를 보증하지 않는다.
end note
OCRServiceBoundary -right-> Gemini
BInputPrescription -down-> MedicationNameVerifier : verifies medication names
BInputPrescription -down-> BMedicationSchedule : response DTO
MedicationNameVerifier --> MatchSafety : rejects incompatible OCR / AI correction
PrescriptionAnalysisPreviewUI --> MedBuddyPrescriptionViewModel : review and confirm one row
PrescriptionAnalysisPreviewUI --> MedicationCandidateDialog : explicit candidate choice
FInputPrescription --> MedBuddyPrescriptionViewModel : 인식 단계·복약 일정
MedBuddyPrescriptionViewModel --> FCheckMedicationDetail : OCR 직후 1차 조회; 여섯 건 병렬·사용 중 1회 재시도
FCheckMedicationDetail --> BCheckMedicationDetail : /identify + original_text + search_mode
FCheckMedicationDetail --> MedicationMatchReview : confirmation-only candidates
FCheckMedicationDetail --> MedicationLookupBusy : known account-busy 503 + retryAt
BCheckMedicationDetail --> MatchSafety : original strength / dosage form; exact name only
PrescriptionAnalysisPreviewUI --> CheckResultUI : 저장 단계
CheckResultUI *-- PrescriptionChangeRadarUI : 결과 목록 첫 칸 (기본 접힘)
MedBuddyPrescriptionViewModel --> FCheckPrescriptionChange : 결과 화면 진입 뒤 비교 조회
FCheckPrescriptionChange --> BCheckPrescriptionChange : POST /prescription/change-radar

note bottom of PrescriptionOcrReadingOrder
  기기 인식기는 약봉투를 열 단위로 돌려준다.
  빈 세로 여백으로 나눈 구역 안에서 행 순서로 놓고
  이웃 열의 같은 행은 이어 둔다. 줄은 합치지 않는다.
end note

note bottom of CheckResultUI
  약별 결과 카드는 접고 펼치며 Radar 조회 실패로
  목록 위치가 바뀌어도 펼친 상태를 같은 약에 유지한다.
  Radar(기본 접힘)는 일정 변경·새로 확인·이번에 없음 등 간단한 분류로 묶는다.
end note

note right of MedicationNameVerifier
  Standalone catalog-name verification service.
  Isolates database work from the OCR control
  and permits AI corrections only from bounded
  authoritative catalog candidates.
  Captures an Engine-only worker factory at composition;
  worker reads never consult a borrowed request Session/Connection.
  Connection-local in-memory SQLite retains same-thread reads.
end note

note bottom of PrescriptionAnalysisPreviewUI
  OCR 직후 1차 조회를 마친 뒤 약별 카드에서 검토한다.
  확인·후보·결과 없음·실패·조회 전 상태를 구분한다.
  검토·결과 요약은 진입 즉시 상단 고정이며 대기·슬라이딩이 없다.
  후보 확정·일정 검토·약 저장은 별도 사용자 동작이다.
end note

note bottom of MatchSafety
  모든 검색 방식에서 원문 함량·제형을 검사한다.
  함량 누락 후보는 수동 확인만 가능하며 충돌 후보는 제외한다.
  단일 정확 일치와 후보 요약 완결성을 확인한 경우만 자동 확정한다.
  확인 전용 응답은 data가 비어 있으며 치료상 대체를 판단하지 않는다.
end note

note bottom of PrescriptionImageCropService
  Orientation, crop and JPEG encoding run
  in a compute isolate, including temporary
  source cleanup. OCR input stays unchanged.
end note

note top of GuidedPrescriptionCameraUI
  Camera quality and guide coordinates
  are checked before capture. Sensor rotation
  is allowed only while this UI is active.
end note
@enduml
